WithdrawnDate":null,"state":"CA"},{"bioguideId":"B001300","fullName":"Rep. Barragán, Nanette Diaz [D-CA-44]","isOriginalCosponsor":false,"party":"D","sponsorshipDate":"2025-11-21","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"CA"},{"bioguideId":"L000593","fullName":"Rep. Levin, Mike [D-CA-49]","isOriginalCosponsor":false,"party":"D","sponsorshipDate":"2025-11-21","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"CA"},{"bioguideId":"R000305","fullName":"Rep. Ross, Deborah K. [D-NC-2]","isOriginalCosponsor":false,"party":"D","sponsorshipDate":"2025-11-25","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"NC"}],"fetchedAt":"2026-09-16T20:44:17+00:00","id":"hr2539-119","introducedDate":"2025-04-01","latestAction":{"actionDate":"2025-04-01","text":"Referred to the House Committee on Education and Workforce."},"laws":[],"number":"2539","originChamber":"House","policyArea":"Agriculture and Food","sponsors":[{"bioguideId":"C001125","district":2,"fullName":"Rep. Carter, Troy A. [D-LA-2]","party":"D","state":"LA"}],"summaries":[{"actionDate":"2025-04-01","actionDesc":"Introduced in House","text":"<p><strong>Freedom in School Cafeterias and Lunches Act or the FISCAL Act</strong></p><p>This bill revises requirements for milk provided by the National School Lunch Program of the Department of Agriculture (USDA) to require that schools offer plant-based milk.</p><p>Under current law, schools must provide a substitute for fluid milk for students whose disability restricts their diet (on receipt of a written statement from a licensed physician). Schools may also substitute a nondairy beverage for fluid milk for students who have an identified medical or other special dietary need (on receipt of a written statement from a medical authority or a&nbsp;student's parent or legal guardian).</p><p>The bill eliminates the exceptions and documentation requirements. Instead, schools participating in the school lunch program must offer all students a plant-based milk option that is&nbsp;consistent with (1) the most recent U.S. Dietary Guidelines, or (2) USDA-established nutritional standards&nbsp;if the milk is&nbsp;not included under those guidelines. </p>","updateDate":"2026-02-25T19:58:50Z","versionCode":"00"}],"title":"FISCAL Act","type":"hr","updateDate":"2026-02-25T20:00:40Z","updateDateIncludingText":"2026-02-25T20:00:40Z"}
